Group: backend
  Name:           Backend
  Default path:   /repo/backend
  Max concurrent: 1
  Sessions:       2

Claude config (resolved for a session in this group):
  config_dir: <SANDBOX_HOME>/.claude  [default]
  env_file:   (none)
  command:    claude  [default]
  model:      (none — per-session model or Claude's own default)
  env:        (none)
  plugins:    (none)
  mcps:       (none)
